  "notes": "订阅切换更可靠，升级提示更清晰。\n\n- 修复快速切换订阅时，当前选择与实际生效配置可能不一致的问题。\n- 订阅服务明确要求升级时，显示清晰提示与官方下载入口，保留现有账号和配置。\n- 完善更新兼容信息的校验。\n",
  "notesEn": "More reliable profile switching and clearer upgrade guidance.\n\n- Fix a race where switching profiles quickly could leave the active configuration out of sync with the selected profile.\n- Show a clear message and official download link when a subscription service requires an upgrade, while keeping the existing account and configuration.\n- Improve validation of update compatibility information.\n",
